#: src/app/PluginAccessReview.tsx
msgid "Each request goes to port 443 on a public address and follows no redirect: the plugin sees where a redirect points and decides whether to ask again. Buzz reads at most the page's head and returns only its preview fields, never the page itself. The address check can't recognize internal sites that resolve to public addresses, such as those reached through a company VPN, so the plugin has to refuse those itself. Sites see your IP address."
msgstr "每个请求都发往公开地址的 443 端口且不跟随重定向：插件能看到重定向指向哪里，并决定是否再次请求。Buzz 最多读取页面 head 部分并只返回其预览字段，绝不返回页面本身。地址检查无法识别解析到公开地址的内部站点（如通过公司 VPN 访问的站点），插件需自行拒绝这类地址。网站会看到你的 IP 地址。"

#: src/app/PluginAccessReview.tsx
msgid "Each request goes to port 443 on a public address and follows no redirect: the plugin sees where a redirect points and decides whether to ask again. Only PNG, JPEG, GIF, WebP and AVIF images are returned. The address check can't recognize internal sites that resolve to public addresses, such as those reached through a company VPN, so the plugin has to refuse those itself. Sites see your IP address."
msgstr "每个请求都发往公开地址的 443 端口且不跟随重定向：插件能看到重定向指向哪里，并决定是否再次请求。仅返回 PNG、JPEG、GIF、WebP 和 AVIF 图片。地址检查无法识别解析到公开地址的内部站点（如通过公司 VPN 访问的站点），插件需自行拒绝这类地址。网站会看到你的 IP 地址。"

